                  "text": "Revise the tool-selection and response policy for `delete_test_workspace` so the agent only uses it for explicit deletion requests and never as a fallback for read-only status queries. When no read-only status tool exists, the agent should return a capability-limited answer that states the status cannot be retrieved from the configured toolset, rather than implying an operational verification was performed."
